    "v_332b3a33025e2e43_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 606.830998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "老话说，地上文物看山西，可您知道山西那么多国宝古剑，最不可思议的到底是哪一座吗？上集，咱们聊了镇国寺，崇明寺崇福寺圣母殿、永乐宫三清殿这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名不可思议到什么程度，尤其是排在榜首的那座，全身上下不用一颗铁钉。近千年里，经历过几十次，大地震，靠着五十四种木笋关节化解冲击。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，大同浑源、悬空寺，山西大同，他挂在衡山金龙峡的绝壁上，离地几十米，北魏就开始修一千五百年，您站在谷底，往上望几十根细木户顶着一整座楼阁，腿肚子都要发软，可您被骗了。当年的工匠是把桐油浸泡过的铁杉木横梁，一根一根深深凿进岩石里半插飞良，那才是真正的承重。底下那些细柱子多半是给您壮胆，用的这座寺不是撑在悬崖上，是挂在岩石的骨头里。一千五百年的视觉骗局骗过了多少代人？您说古代工匠是不是太懂人心了？第四名，万荣飞云楼山西运城万荣。他在东岳庙里是明代的纯木楼阁，通高将近二十三米。三层四言，您走到楼下，头顶层层叠叠。全是斗拱，一共三百四十五朵，没有两朵，长得一样，整座楼没用一颗铁钉。全靠木头自己有何四角的飞檐？一层一层翘出去，远远看去，像一朵停在半空的云，所以才叫飞云楼。三百多个小木块，拼出一座空中楼阁，被人誉为中华第一木楼。他不像是盖出来的，倒像是木头，自己长成了一朵云。这份精巧，您说是不是美的，让人不敢眨眼。第三名，运城解州关帝庙春秋楼，山西运城解州界州是关羽的老家，春秋楼里供着关公夜读春秋的像。这座楼有个让行家都服气的绝活，叫悬梁吊柱。楼上一圈回廊的柱子居然不落地，一根根悬在半空，您要是在楼里走一圈，伸手就能从柱子底下穿过去。上层的重盐那么重，全靠垂铸和暗损一层一层吊着漂亮，看惯了悬空寺挂在崖上，谁见过大楼里的柱子挂在半空，柱子必须落地才能承重。这条咱们脑子里的老规矩，在这座楼里被一把推翻了。这不是机关，这是把力学玩到了神仙地步。第二名，五台山佛光寺东大殿，山西忻州。这是唐大宗十一年留下来的皇家墓构大殿，也是全中国现存体量最大的盛唐墓构。当年日本学者断言中国本土绝无唐代木构建筑。想看唐风只能去耐良。一九三七年，梁思成和林徽因两位先生骑着骡子，翻山越岭来到五台山，在被臭虫咬的遍体鳞伤。蝙蝠粪便堆积如山的漆黑梁架上借着手电筒的一点微光，在幕梁上摸出了女弟子宁公寓的唐代墨书题记，彻底粉碎了外国学者的轻蔑。断言，那单体挑出近四米，如同雄鹰展翅的七步，做巨大斗拱，撑起的不仅是一座唐代佛殿，更是属于我们中华民族刻在木头里的铮铮傲骨。第五到第二，讲完了揭晓。投名前，我先唠几句心里话，评论区里，不少朋友说的话特别一致，说也去过山西，进过佛光寺晋过晋祠，可站在殿前光顾着拍照了。头顶上的一层压一层的斗拱，叫什么粮价，怎么搭起来的，一句也说不出来，回来跟没去一样，也有人说老早就想去。可山西的古剑散在三晋大地上，一处跟一处隔着好几百里。不知道该先看哪一处，还有人想给孙辈讲讲这老木头的门道，可自己翻来覆去就那么几句，说不深，咱们看古剑早不止图个热闹。想弄明白的是，这木头里到底藏着什么，讲究什么来头，可这些东西手机上刷两条就忘。网上查东一块西一块术语还绕口，抱起专业书图，小字秘，眼睛先吃不消。前阵子，我翻到一本对路的书，叫了不起的山西古建筑，跟着仿古女神连连打卡。山西国宝遗存。作者，王慧莲仿古走了二十多年，把把山西五十多处国宝古建理的清清楚楚，把一处都是高清大图打头，然后是大白话讲解，把这一处后面的门道掰开了，揉碎了，全全部讲给您听一处几百字，讲的明明白白，里头还收了梁思成先生当年一笔一笔手绘的建筑图，还有营造学社的老照片。我自己是这么用的，能动身去的，出门前翻两页，站到殿前，心里就有底，看见的就不是一堆旧木头，是活生生的门道去不了的。沏壶热茶就着大图和文字慢慢看，也算把三晋大地走了一遭，搁在茶几上。孙辈随手翻两眼，长见识，写作文都用得上，老两口晚上翻翻，商量，明年去一趟。山西。比刷手机有意思多了，房子会旧积蓄会花完。可老祖宗留下来的文化底蕴，传多少代都贬不了职，这根脉一旦断了课就不好接了。感兴趣的朋友下方小黄车点进去看看，眼下走不到山西，咱就先把这部活着的建筑史书请进屋里，好说回正题。第一名，应县木塔，山西朔州、应县为什么是它？因为它是全人类建筑史上唯一把木头力学推向物理神话的奇迹。整座塔高达六十七点三一米，相当于二十多层摩天大楼的高度耗费了三千多立方米。红松木料通体没用一根铁钉。公元一零五六年，辽代工匠修建他时，独创了八面双层套筒结构，全塔塞进的多达五十四种不同形式的斗拱。这些斗拱不是简单的斗拱，而是几百个能伸缩、能吸能的巨型木质弹簧。近千年来，塞北经历了四十多层，是强烈地震。方圆几十里房屋荡平木塔，只是微微摇晃。民国军阀混战两百多发真实的炮弹。正面打穿，他身炸断了大梁，他吃下所有充饥，依旧巍然矗立在苍茫。天地之间，现代建筑力学家用电脑建模反复计算，不得不承认，这根本不是樊间的手艺。这是千年前东方工匠用木头与天地风雷完成的一场漫长较量。十座三进古墓构讲完了镇国寺的大斗拱，称其五代崇明寺的断粮断了一千年，重福寺抽调八根柱子。圣母殿的慕容千年不烂，永乐宫大殿拆散搬迁，异地重圆，悬空寺暗藏飞梁，挂在绝壁飞云楼，是三百四十五朵斗拱拼出的云，春秋楼悬梁吊著机巧通神。佛光寺东大殿，盛堂斗拱撑起民族骨气。可只有应县木塔把千万块木骨化作弹簧，接下了天灾，战火的百般摧折，至今依然傲视全人类的幕构巅峰。您说什么叫不可思议？最不可思议的，从来不是盖的有多奢华，而是在没有钢筋水泥的年代，老祖宗单凭最朴素的木料与榫卯，就给岁月留下了摧不垮的脊梁。这十座山西木构，您去过哪几座最想去哪一座？刚才说的那本了不起的山西古建筑橱窗和左下角小黄车都有，喜欢看老建筑的朋友，别错过想听更多古代工匠的传奇神迹。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00001",
      "start_ms": 330,
      "end_ms": 1010,
      "text": "老话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1430,
      "end_ms": 3510,
      "text": "地上文物看山西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4310,
      "end_ms": 7230,
      "text": "可您知道山西那么多国宝古剑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7530,
      "end_ms": 10270,
      "text": "最不可思议的到底是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10630,
      "end_ms": 11130,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11130,
      "end_ms": 12430,
      "text": "咱们聊了镇国寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12530,
      "end_ms": 18830,
      "text": "崇明寺崇福寺圣母殿、永乐宫三清殿这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19330,
      "end_ms": 22350,
      "text": "看看前五名不可思议到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22750,
      "end_ms": 25050,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25650,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "全身上下不用一颗铁钉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28850,
      "end_ms": 29845,
      "text": "近千年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 31280,
      "text": "经历过几十次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31280,
      "end_ms": 31860,
      "text": "大地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32280,
      "end_ms": 35700,
      "text": "靠着五十四种木笋关节化解冲击。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36080,
      "end_ms": 36840,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37200,
      "end_ms": 38400,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38740,
      "end_ms": 40740,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41160,
      "end_ms": 42240,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00019",
      "start_ms": 42560,
      "end_ms": 43260,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44000,
      "end_ms": 45840,
      "text": "大同浑源、悬空寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46260,
      "end_ms": 47220,
      "text": "山西大同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00022",
      "start_ms": 47940,
      "end_ms": 50760,
      "text": "他挂在衡山金龙峡的绝壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00023",
      "start_ms": 51480,
      "end_ms": 52800,
      "text": "离地几十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00024",
      "start_ms": 53100,
      "end_ms": 55740,
      "text": "北魏就开始修一千五百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00025",
      "start_ms": 56280,
      "end_ms": 57320,
      "text": "您站在谷底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00026",
      "start_ms": 57320,
      "end_ms": 62055,
      "text": "往上望几十根细木户顶着一整座楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00027",
      "start_ms": 62670,
      "end_ms": 64025,
      "text": "腿肚子都要发软，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00028",
      "start_ms": 64550,
      "end_ms": 65505,
      "text": "可您被骗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00029",
      "start_ms": 65920,
      "end_ms": 70465,
      "text": "当年的工匠是把桐油浸泡过的铁杉木横梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00030",
      "start_ms": 70960,
      "end_ms": 75420,
      "text": "一根一根深深凿进岩石里半插飞良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75700,
      "end_ms": 77565,
      "text": "那才是真正的承重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00032",
      "start_ms": 78280,
      "end_ms": 81660,
      "text": "底下那些细柱子多半是给您壮胆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81660,
      "end_ms": 85015,
      "text": "用的这座寺不是撑在悬崖上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00034",
      "start_ms": 85460,
      "end_ms": 87435,
      "text": "是挂在岩石的骨头里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00035",
      "start_ms": 88160,
      "end_ms": 92865,
      "text": "一千五百年的视觉骗局骗过了多少代人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00036",
      "start_ms": 93640,
      "end_ms": 96585,
      "text": "您说古代工匠是不是太懂人心了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96950,
      "end_ms": 97765,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98200,
      "end_ms": 101505,
      "text": "万荣飞云楼山西运城万荣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00039",
      "start_ms": 102270,
      "end_ms": 105885,
      "text": "他在东岳庙里是明代的纯木楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106410,
      "end_ms": 108135,
      "text": "通高将近二十三米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108510,
      "end_ms": 109695,
      "text": "三层四言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110100,
      "end_ms": 111095,
      "text": "您走到楼下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00043",
      "start_ms": 111450,
      "end_ms": 112950,
      "text": "头顶层层叠叠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00044",
      "start_ms": 112950,
      "end_ms": 113785,
      "text": "全是斗拱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00045",
      "start_ms": 114250,
      "end_ms": 115815,
      "text": "一共三百四十五朵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00046",
      "start_ms": 116620,
      "end_ms": 117420,
      "text": "没有两朵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00047",
      "start_ms": 117420,
      "end_ms": 118215,
      "text": "长得一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00048",
      "start_ms": 118960,
      "end_ms": 121125,
      "text": "整座楼没用一颗铁钉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00049",
      "start_ms": 121970,
      "end_ms": 125660,
      "text": "全靠木头自己有何四角的飞檐？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00050",
      "start_ms": 125740,
      "end_ms": 127145,
      "text": "一层一层翘出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127640,
      "end_ms": 128725,
      "text": "远远看去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00052",
      "start_ms": 129110,
      "end_ms": 131155,
      "text": "像一朵停在半空的云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131800,
      "end_ms": 133385,
      "text": "所以才叫飞云楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00054",
      "start_ms": 134130,
      "end_ms": 135575,
      "text": "三百多个小木块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00055",
      "start_ms": 136040,
      "end_ms": 137915,
      "text": "拼出一座空中楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00056",
      "start_ms": 138610,
      "end_ms": 141025,
      "text": "被人誉为中华第一木楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141450,
      "end_ms": 143055,
      "text": "他不像是盖出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143540,
      "end_ms": 145020,
      "text": "倒像是木头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00059",
      "start_ms": 145040,
      "end_ms": 146545,
      "text": "自己长成了一朵云。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147450,
      "end_ms": 148595,
      "text": "这份精巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00061",
      "start_ms": 149070,
      "end_ms": 150110,
      "text": "您说是不是美的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00062",
      "start_ms": 150110,
      "end_ms": 151145,
      "text": "让人不敢眨眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00063",
      "start_ms": 151550,
      "end_ms": 152230,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00064",
      "start_ms": 152530,
      "end_ms": 155540,
      "text": "运城解州关帝庙春秋楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00065",
      "start_ms": 155760,
      "end_ms": 160185,
      "text": "山西运城解州界州是关羽的老家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00066",
      "start_ms": 160710,
      "end_ms": 164125,
      "text": "春秋楼里供着关公夜读春秋的像。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00067",
      "start_ms": 164820,
      "end_ms": 167840,
      "text": "这座楼有个让行家都服气的绝活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00068",
      "start_ms": 168100,
      "end_ms": 169615,
      "text": "叫悬梁吊柱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00069",
      "start_ms": 170080,
      "end_ms": 173585,
      "text": "楼上一圈回廊的柱子居然不落地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00070",
      "start_ms": 174150,
      "end_ms": 175935,
      "text": "一根根悬在半空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00071",
      "start_ms": 176830,
      "end_ms": 178495,
      "text": "您要是在楼里走一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00072",
      "start_ms": 178860,
      "end_ms": 180985,
      "text": "伸手就能从柱子底下穿过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00073",
      "start_ms": 181440,
      "end_ms": 183335,
      "text": "上层的重盐那么重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00074",
      "start_ms": 184140,
      "end_ms": 189020,
      "text": "全靠垂铸和暗损一层一层吊着漂亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00075",
      "start_ms": 189710,
      "end_ms": 192215,
      "text": "看惯了悬空寺挂在崖上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00076",
      "start_ms": 192860,
      "end_ms": 195845,
      "text": "谁见过大楼里的柱子挂在半空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00077",
      "start_ms": 196330,
      "end_ms": 198415,
      "text": "柱子必须落地才能承重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00078",
      "start_ms": 199250,
      "end_ms": 201385,
      "text": "这条咱们脑子里的老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00079",
      "start_ms": 201750,
      "end_ms": 204485,
      "text": "在这座楼里被一把推翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00080",
      "start_ms": 205100,
      "end_ms": 206385,
      "text": "这不是机关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00081",
      "start_ms": 207010,
      "end_ms": 209765,
      "text": "这是把力学玩到了神仙地步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00082",
      "start_ms": 210170,
      "end_ms": 210750,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00083",
      "start_ms": 211050,
      "end_ms": 213085,
      "text": "五台山佛光寺东大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00084",
      "start_ms": 213410,
      "end_ms": 214595,
      "text": "山西忻州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00085",
      "start_ms": 215350,
      "end_ms": 218765,
      "text": "这是唐大宗十一年留下来的皇家墓构大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00086",
      "start_ms": 219400,
      "end_ms": 223025,
      "text": "也是全中国现存体量最大的盛唐墓构。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00087",
      "start_ms": 223440,
      "end_ms": 228315,
      "text": "当年日本学者断言中国本土绝无唐代木构建筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00088",
      "start_ms": 228840,
      "end_ms": 231285,
      "text": "想看唐风只能去耐良。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00089",
      "start_ms": 231800,
      "end_ms": 232935,
      "text": "一九三七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00090",
      "start_ms": 233760,
      "end_ms": 236920,
      "text": "梁思成和林徽因两位先生骑着骡子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00091",
      "start_ms": 236920,
      "end_ms": 238745,
      "text": "翻山越岭来到五台山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00092",
      "start_ms": 239570,
      "end_ms": 242005,
      "text": "在被臭虫咬的遍体鳞伤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00093",
      "start_ms": 242600,
      "end_ms": 248705,
      "text": "蝙蝠粪便堆积如山的漆黑梁架上借着手电筒的一点微光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00094",
      "start_ms": 249100,
      "end_ms": 254205,
      "text": "在幕梁上摸出了女弟子宁公寓的唐代墨书题记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00095",
      "start_ms": 255040,
      "end_ms": 258180,
      "text": "彻底粉碎了外国学者的轻蔑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00096",
      "start_ms": 258220,
      "end_ms": 258805,
      "text": "断言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00097",
      "start_ms": 259260,
      "end_ms": 261080,
      "text": "那单体挑出近四米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00098",
      "start_ms": 261100,
      "end_ms": 263160,
      "text": "如同雄鹰展翅的七步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00099",
      "start_ms": 263160,
      "end_ms": 264305,
      "text": "做巨大斗拱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00100",
      "start_ms": 265010,
      "end_ms": 267945,
      "text": "撑起的不仅是一座唐代佛殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00101",
      "start_ms": 268490,
      "end_ms": 272875,
      "text": "更是属于我们中华民族刻在木头里的铮铮傲骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00102",
      "start_ms": 273310,
      "end_ms": 274230,
      "text": "第五到第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00103",
      "start_ms": 274230,
      "end_ms": 275690,
      "text": "讲完了揭晓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00104",
      "start_ms": 275690,
      "end_ms": 276475,
      "text": "投名前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00105",
      "start_ms": 277180,
      "end_ms": 278765,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00106",
      "start_ms": 279130,
      "end_ms": 279770,
      "text": "评论区里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00107",
      "start_ms": 279770,
      "end_ms": 281685,
      "text": "不少朋友说的话特别一致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00108",
      "start_ms": 282210,
      "end_ms": 283555,
      "text": "说也去过山西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00109",
      "start_ms": 284000,
      "end_ms": 286225,
      "text": "进过佛光寺晋过晋祠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00110",
      "start_ms": 286870,
      "end_ms": 289295,
      "text": "可站在殿前光顾着拍照了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00111",
      "start_ms": 289730,
      "end_ms": 292010,
      "text": "头顶上的一层压一层的斗拱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00112",
      "start_ms": 292010,
      "end_ms": 293500,
      "text": "叫什么粮价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00113",
      "start_ms": 293620,
      "end_ms": 294665,
      "text": "怎么搭起来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00114",
      "start_ms": 295160,
      "end_ms": 296070,
      "text": "一句也说不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00115",
      "start_ms": 296750,
      "end_ms": 297835,
      "text": "回来跟没去一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00116",
      "start_ms": 298560,
      "end_ms": 300225,
      "text": "也有人说老早就想去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00117",
      "start_ms": 301050,
      "end_ms": 303765,
      "text": "可山西的古剑散在三晋大地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00118",
      "start_ms": 304300,
      "end_ms": 306175,
      "text": "一处跟一处隔着好几百里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00119",
      "start_ms": 306710,
      "end_ms": 308470,
      "text": "不知道该先看哪一处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00120",
      "start_ms": 308890,
      "end_ms": 312310,
      "text": "还有人想给孙辈讲讲这老木头的门道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00121",
      "start_ms": 312750,
      "end_ms": 315110,
      "text": "可自己翻来覆去就那么几句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00122",
      "start_ms": 315570,
      "end_ms": 316250,
      "text": "说不深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00123",
      "start_ms": 317090,
      "end_ms": 320210,
      "text": "咱们看古剑早不止图个热闹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00124",
      "start_ms": 320610,
      "end_ms": 321830,
      "text": "想弄明白的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00125",
      "start_ms": 321830,
      "end_ms": 323710,
      "text": "这木头里到底藏着什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00126",
      "start_ms": 323710,
      "end_ms": 325470,
      "text": "讲究什么来头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00127",
      "start_ms": 325890,
      "end_ms": 328830,
      "text": "可这些东西手机上刷两条就忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00128",
      "start_ms": 329110,
      "end_ms": 332290,
      "text": "网上查东一块西一块术语还绕口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00129",
      "start_ms": 332610,
      "end_ms": 334270,
      "text": "抱起专业书图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00130",
      "start_ms": 334270,
      "end_ms": 334930,
      "text": "小字秘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00131",
      "start_ms": 335130,
      "end_ms": 336365,
      "text": "眼睛先吃不消。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00132",
      "start_ms": 337020,
      "end_ms": 337600,
      "text": "前阵子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00133",
      "start_ms": 337600,
      "end_ms": 339260,
      "text": "我翻到一本对路的书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00134",
      "start_ms": 339660,
      "end_ms": 341840,
      "text": "叫了不起的山西古建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00135",
      "start_ms": 342480,
      "end_ms": 345240,
      "text": "跟着仿古女神连连打卡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00136",
      "start_ms": 345300,
      "end_ms": 346560,
      "text": "山西国宝遗存。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00137",
      "start_ms": 347000,
      "end_ms": 347580,
      "text": "作者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00138",
      "start_ms": 347620,
      "end_ms": 350760,
      "text": "王慧莲仿古走了二十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00139",
      "start_ms": 351420,
      "end_ms": 355480,
      "text": "把把山西五十多处国宝古建理的清清楚楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00140",
      "start_ms": 356060,
      "end_ms": 358520,
      "text": "把一处都是高清大图打头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00141",
      "start_ms": 359220,
      "end_ms": 361100,
      "text": "然后是大白话讲解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00142",
      "start_ms": 361700,
      "end_ms": 364640,
      "text": "把这一处后面的门道掰开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00143",
      "start_ms": 365100,
      "end_ms": 365860,
      "text": "揉碎了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00144",
      "start_ms": 365860,
      "end_ms": 369295,
      "text": "全全部讲给您听一处几百字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00145",
      "start_ms": 369700,
      "end_ms": 371035,
      "text": "讲的明明白白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00146",
      "start_ms": 371700,
      "end_ms": 376345,
      "text": "里头还收了梁思成先生当年一笔一笔手绘的建筑图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00147",
      "start_ms": 377040,
      "end_ms": 379015,
      "text": "还有营造学社的老照片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00148",
      "start_ms": 379450,
      "end_ms": 380815,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00149",
      "start_ms": 381190,
      "end_ms": 382475,
      "text": "能动身去的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00150",
      "start_ms": 382770,
      "end_ms": 384255,
      "text": "出门前翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00151",
      "start_ms": 384590,
      "end_ms": 385510,
      "text": "站到殿前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00152",
      "start_ms": 385530,
      "end_ms": 386485,
      "text": "心里就有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00153",
      "start_ms": 386820,
      "end_ms": 388875,
      "text": "看见的就不是一堆旧木头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00154",
      "start_ms": 389240,
      "end_ms": 392165,
      "text": "是活生生的门道去不了的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00155",
      "start_ms": 392490,
      "end_ms": 396585,
      "text": "沏壶热茶就着大图和文字慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00156",
      "start_ms": 397210,
      "end_ms": 399595,
      "text": "也算把三晋大地走了一遭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00157",
      "start_ms": 400360,
      "end_ms": 401365,
      "text": "搁在茶几上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00158",
      "start_ms": 401720,
      "end_ms": 403285,
      "text": "孙辈随手翻两眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00159",
      "start_ms": 403690,
      "end_ms": 404485,
      "text": "长见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00160",
      "start_ms": 404840,
      "end_ms": 406565,
      "text": "写作文都用得上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00161",
      "start_ms": 406930,
      "end_ms": 408545,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00162",
      "start_ms": 409100,
      "end_ms": 409580,
      "text": "商量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00163",
      "start_ms": 409600,
      "end_ms": 410580,
      "text": "明年去一趟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00164",
      "start_ms": 410580,
      "end_ms": 411195,
      "text": "山西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00165",
      "start_ms": 411950,
      "end_ms": 413895,
      "text": "比刷手机有意思多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00166",
      "start_ms": 414460,
      "end_ms": 416935,
      "text": "房子会旧积蓄会花完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00167",
      "start_ms": 417470,
      "end_ms": 419685,
      "text": "可老祖宗留下来的文化底蕴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00168",
      "start_ms": 420170,
      "end_ms": 422355,
      "text": "传多少代都贬不了职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00169",
      "start_ms": 422750,
      "end_ms": 425735,
      "text": "这根脉一旦断了课就不好接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00170",
      "start_ms": 426300,
      "end_ms": 429560,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友下方小黄车点进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00171",
      "start_ms": 430120,
      "end_ms": 431540,
      "text": "眼下走不到山西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00172",
      "start_ms": 431920,
      "end_ms": 435240,
      "text": "咱就先把这部活着的建筑史书请进屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00173",
      "start_ms": 435540,
      "end_ms": 436920,
      "text": "好说回正题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00174",
      "start_ms": 437280,
      "end_ms": 437880,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00175",
      "start_ms": 438260,
      "end_ms": 439380,
      "text": "应县木塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00176",
      "start_ms": 439880,
      "end_ms": 443080,
      "text": "山西朔州、应县为什么是它？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00177",
      "start_ms": 443460,
      "end_ms": 448880,
      "text": "因为它是全人类建筑史上唯一把木头力学推向物理神话的奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00178",
      "start_ms": 449300,
      "end_ms": 452000,
      "text": "整座塔高达六十七点三一米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00179",
      "start_ms": 452640,
      "end_ms": 458310,
      "text": "相当于二十多层摩天大楼的高度耗费了三千多立方米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00180",
      "start_ms": 458350,
      "end_ms": 461670,
      "text": "红松木料通体没用一根铁钉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00181",
      "start_ms": 462050,
      "end_ms": 463470,
      "text": "公元一零五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00182",
      "start_ms": 463530,
      "end_ms": 465250,
      "text": "辽代工匠修建他时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00183",
      "start_ms": 465750,
      "end_ms": 468670,
      "text": "独创了八面双层套筒结构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00184",
      "start_ms": 469170,
      "end_ms": 473150,
      "text": "全塔塞进的多达五十四种不同形式的斗拱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00185",
      "start_ms": 473490,
      "end_ms": 475670,
      "text": "这些斗拱不是简单的斗拱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00186",
      "start_ms": 476490,
      "end_ms": 482010,
      "text": "而是几百个能伸缩、能吸能的巨型木质弹簧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00187",
      "start_ms": 482510,
      "end_ms": 483510,
      "text": "近千年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00188",
      "start_ms": 484170,
      "end_ms": 486060,
      "text": "塞北经历了四十多层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00189",
      "start_ms": 486140,
      "end_ms": 487205,
      "text": "是强烈地震。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00190",
      "start_ms": 487850,
      "end_ms": 491400,
      "text": "方圆几十里房屋荡平木塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00191",
      "start_ms": 491460,
      "end_ms": 492655,
      "text": "只是微微摇晃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00192",
      "start_ms": 493240,
      "end_ms": 497025,
      "text": "民国军阀混战两百多发真实的炮弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00193",
      "start_ms": 497290,
      "end_ms": 498250,
      "text": "正面打穿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00194",
      "start_ms": 498270,
      "end_ms": 500175,
      "text": "他身炸断了大梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00195",
      "start_ms": 500660,
      "end_ms": 502505,
      "text": "他吃下所有充饥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00196",
      "start_ms": 503020,
      "end_ms": 505660,
      "text": "依旧巍然矗立在苍茫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00197",
      "start_ms": 505780,
      "end_ms": 506715,
      "text": "天地之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00198",
      "start_ms": 507140,
      "end_ms": 510565,
      "text": "现代建筑力学家用电脑建模反复计算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00199",
      "start_ms": 511080,
      "end_ms": 511955,
      "text": "不得不承认，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00200",
      "start_ms": 512400,
      "end_ms": 514735,
      "text": "这根本不是樊间的手艺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00201",
      "start_ms": 515570,
      "end_ms": 521375,
      "text": "这是千年前东方工匠用木头与天地风雷完成的一场漫长较量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00202",
      "start_ms": 521840,
      "end_ms": 525990,
      "text": "十座三进古墓构讲完了镇国寺的大斗拱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00203",
      "start_ms": 526130,
      "end_ms": 530295,
      "text": "称其五代崇明寺的断粮断了一千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00204",
      "start_ms": 530960,
      "end_ms": 533005,
      "text": "重福寺抽调八根柱子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00205",
      "start_ms": 533460,
      "end_ms": 535475,
      "text": "圣母殿的慕容千年不烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00206",
      "start_ms": 536160,
      "end_ms": 538340,
      "text": "永乐宫大殿拆散搬迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00207",
      "start_ms": 538520,
      "end_ms": 539400,
      "text": "异地重圆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00208",
      "start_ms": 539820,
      "end_ms": 541800,
      "text": "悬空寺暗藏飞梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00209",
      "start_ms": 542160,
      "end_ms": 544180,
      "text": "挂在绝壁飞云楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00210",
      "start_ms": 544200,
      "end_ms": 547095,
      "text": "是三百四十五朵斗拱拼出的云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00211",
      "start_ms": 547520,
      "end_ms": 550355,
      "text": "春秋楼悬梁吊著机巧通神。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00212",
      "start_ms": 550770,
      "end_ms": 552150,
      "text": "佛光寺东大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00213",
      "start_ms": 552210,
      "end_ms": 554715,
      "text": "盛堂斗拱撑起民族骨气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00214",
      "start_ms": 555160,
      "end_ms": 559895,
      "text": "可只有应县木塔把千万块木骨化作弹簧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00215",
      "start_ms": 560550,
      "end_ms": 561630,
      "text": "接下了天灾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00216",
      "start_ms": 561670,
      "end_ms": 563385,
      "text": "战火的百般摧折，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00217",
      "start_ms": 563840,
      "end_ms": 567415,
      "text": "至今依然傲视全人类的幕构巅峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00218",
      "start_ms": 567920,
      "end_ms": 569285,
      "text": "您说什么叫不可思议？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00219",
      "start_ms": 569770,
      "end_ms": 571190,
      "text": "最不可思议的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00220",
      "start_ms": 571190,
      "end_ms": 573775,
      "text": "从来不是盖的有多奢华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00221",
      "start_ms": 574370,
      "end_ms": 576815,
      "text": "而是在没有钢筋水泥的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00222",
      "start_ms": 577300,
      "end_ms": 581044,
      "text": "老祖宗单凭最朴素的木料与榫卯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00223",
      "start_ms": 581610,
      "end_ms": 585125,
      "text": "就给岁月留下了摧不垮的脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00224",
      "start_ms": 585540,
      "end_ms": 587195,
      "text": "这十座山西木构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00225",
      "start_ms": 587770,
      "end_ms": 591415,
      "text": "您去过哪几座最想去哪一座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00226",
      "start_ms": 592080,
      "end_ms": 597895,
      "text": "刚才说的那本了不起的山西古建筑橱窗和左下角小黄车都有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00227",
      "start_ms": 598470,
      "end_ms": 600050,
      "text": "喜欢看老建筑的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00228",
      "start_ms": 600050,
      "end_ms": 603800,
      "text": "别错过想听更多古代工匠的传奇神迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00229",
      "start_ms": 604000,
      "end_ms": 604855,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_332b3a33025e2e43_s00230",
      "start_ms": 605140,
      "end_ms": 606515,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
